<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:03]<b>1<b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:05]It reminds me of when I was at school.</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:09.3]<b>2<b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:11]It makes me feel so happy.</p>]]></text>
